sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant F as Frontend
    participant A as API
    participant S as Service
    participant D as PostgreSQL
    U->>F: Fill in the asset form
    F->>A: POST assets with token and workspace header
    A->>A: Authenticate, check membership, validate fields
    A->>S: Create asset
    S->>D: Insert asset
    S->>D: Insert audit event with the new state
    alt name already exists in this workspace
        D-->>S: Unique constraint violation
        S->>D: Roll back
        A-->>F: 409 asset name conflict
        F-->>U: Show the message
    else saved
        S->>D: Commit both rows
        A-->>F: 201 with asset and audit event ID
        F-->>U: Refresh the catalog
    end
